{
  "video_id": "37IaAbDDFh4",
  "title": "How to prompt AI like a pro",
  "description": "When you're prompting AI, give it these 4 things every time",
  "publishedAt": "2026-06-12T11:13:09Z",
  "channel_name": "Dan Martell",
  "transcript": "Every single time [music] you prompt AI, you have to give it these four things. I call it the MAPS framework. The M is mission. What are you trying to accomplish? Don't start with what you need, start with the desired outcome or the goal. I want to grow my business. The A is ask. [music] Ask the AI for what you want. P is for parameters. If you have a folder with everything about your business, give it to it. The S is for shape. What's the format, [music] the output? Bullet points, concise, numbered list. Do you want it to be direct? Do you want it to be nice? Give it some shape. If you follow those four steps every single time, it doesn't [music] matter what AI you're using, you will get the best response. And if you're not sure which tool you should be using, just comment the word stack [music] below and I'll send you my full AI stack.",
